Ardea playbook pack (Pro / MSP)

Put the playbook pack you downloaded from your Ardea order here, e.g. ardea-playbooks-2026.11.ardpack.
The worker picks it up within a minute; no restart needed. If several packs are here, the newest one is used.

The pack is signed. A pack that was changed after signing is refused (see the worker log). To change a
playbook for your environment, copy it into worker/playbooks.yaml: your own playbooks always win.
